<newsitem itemid="624905" id="root" date="1997-05-29" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: Firstone 1996 net loss HK$87.38 mln.</title>
<headline>Firstone 1996 net loss HK$87.38 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  20.4 loss  vs 0.8 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 3.60 gain  vs 1.56 gain</p>
<p>    Net			   87.38 loss vs 2.11 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		    405.83     vs 374.44</p>
<p>    Company name		Firstone International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 June 24-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Firstone is a manufacturer of capacitors.</p>
<p>Net is after exceptional items representing the aggregate amounts of the gain on the deemed disposal of equity interests in certain subsidiaries of HK$3.69 million, less the loss on deemed disposal of an equity interest in an associated company of HK$0.09 million, arising from the rights issue of 3.6 million &quot;A&quot; shares of Shenzhen Capstone Industrial Co Ltd, a subsidiary of the company, during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
